<title>JAPAN: Reuters average November Tapis assessed at $24.84.</title>
<headline>Reuters average November Tapis assessed at $24.84.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for November was $24.84.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>    November 1  $26.00  12  $24.75  21  $24.90</p>
<p>		 4  $25.25  13  $24.90  22  $24.70</p>
<p>		 5  $24.90  14  $24.90  25  $24.30</p>
<p>		 6  $24.45  15  $24.95  26  $24.95</p>
<p>		 7  $24.25  18  $24.95  27  $24.85</p>
<p>		 8  $24.58  19  $24.95  28  $24.80</p>
<p>		11  $24.75  20  $24.95  29  $24.70</p>
</text>
